000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. PAYROLL.
000300 AUTHOR. LEGACY-TEAM.
000400*PAYROLL CALC - DO NOT CHANGE W/O APPROVAL
000500 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000600 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000700 FILE-CONTROL.
000800     SELECT EMP-FILE ASSIGN TO EMPIN
000900         ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
001000         FILE STATUS IS WS-EMP-FS.
001100     SELECT PAY-FILE ASSIGN TO PAYOUT
001200         FILE STATUS IS WS-PAY-FS.
001300     SELECT RPT-FILE ASSIGN TO RPTOUT.
001400 DATA DIVISION.
001500 FILE SECTION.
001600 FD  EMP-FILE
001700         RECORDING MODE IS F.
001800     COPY EMPREC.
001900 FD  PAY-FILE.
002000 01  PAY-REC.
002100         05 PAY-EMP-ID          PIC X(6).
002200         05 PAY-GROSS           PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.
002300         05 PAY-FED-TAX         PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.
002400         05 PAY-ST-TAX          PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.
002500         05 PAY-DEDS            PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.
002600         05 PAY-NET             PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.
002700         05 FILLER              PIC X(33).
002800 FD  RPT-FILE.
002900 01  RPT-LINE               PIC X(132).
003000 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
003100 01  WS-SWITCHES.
003200         05 WS-EOF-SW           PIC X VALUE 'N'.
003300            88 END-OF-EMP-FILE        VALUE 'Y'.
003400         05 WS-EMP-FS           PIC XX.
003500         05 WS-PAY-FS           PIC XX.
003600 01  WS-CALC-FIELDS.
003700         05 WS-REG-HRS          PIC S9(3)V9 COMP-3.
003800         05 WS-OT-HRS           PIC S9(3)V9 COMP-3.
003900         05 WS-GROSS-PAY        PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.
004000         05 WS-OT-PAY           PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.
004100         05 WS-TAXABLE          PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.
004200         05 WS-FED-TAX          PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.
004300         05 WS-ST-TAX           PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.
004400         05 WS-TOT-DEDS         PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.
004500         05 WS-NET-PAY          PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.
004600*CONSTANTS
004700 01  WS-CONSTANTS.
004800         05 WS-STD-HRS          PIC 9(3)V9  VALUE 40.0.
004900         05 WS-OT-RATE          PIC 9V99    VALUE 1.50.
005000         05 WS-ST-TAX-RATE      PIC V999    VALUE .045.
005100         05 WS-401K-MAX         PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 23000.00.
005200 01  WS-COUNTERS.
005300         05 WS-REC-CNT          PIC 9(7) COMP VALUE ZERO.
005400         05 WS-ERR-CNT          PIC 9(7) COMP VALUE ZERO.
005500         05 WS-TOT-GROSS        PIC S9(11)V99 COMP-3 VALUE ZERO.
005600 01  WS-TAX-PARMS.
005700         05 TP-TAXABLE          PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.
005800         05 TP-FILING-STATUS    PIC X.
005900         05 TP-FED-TAX          PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.
006000         05 TP-RETURN-CD        PIC XX.
006100 01  WS-DEPT-TABLE.
006200         05 WS-DEPT-ENTRY OCCURS 20 TIMES INDEXED BY DEPT-IDX.
006300            10 WS-DEPT-CD        PIC X(4).
006400            10 WS-DEPT-BONUS-PCT PIC V99.
006500 01  WS-RPT-DETAIL.
006600         05 RD-EMP-ID           PIC X(6).
006700         05 FILLER              PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
006800         05 RD-EMP-NAME         PIC X(30).
006900         05 RD-GROSS            PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZ9.99.
007000         05 FILLER              PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
007100         05 RD-NET              PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZ9.99.
007200 01  WS-RPT-ALT REDEFINES WS-RPT-DETAIL.
007300         05 RA-TEXT             PIC X(64).
007400 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
007500 0000-MAINLINE.
007600         PERFORM 1000-INITIALIZE
007700         PERFORM 2000-PROCESS-EMPLOYEE
007800             UNTIL END-OF-EMP-FILE
007900         PERFORM 9000-TERMINATE
008000         STOP RUN.
008100 1000-INITIALIZE.
008200         OPEN INPUT  EMP-FILE
008300              OUTPUT PAY-FILE RPT-FILE
008400         IF WS-EMP-FS NOT = '00'
008500             DISPLAY 'EMPIN OPEN ERROR ' WS-EMP-FS
008600             MOVE 16 TO RETURN-CODE
008700             GO TO 9999-ABEND
008800         END-IF
008900         PERFORM 1100-READ-EMPLOYEE.
009000 1100-READ-EMPLOYEE.
009100         READ EMP-FILE
009200             AT END SET END-OF-EMP-FILE TO TRUE
009300         END-READ.
009400 2000-PROCESS-EMPLOYEE.
009500         ADD 1 TO WS-REC-CNT
009600         PERFORM 2100-VALIDATE-EMPLOYEE
009700         IF EMP-VALID
009800             PERFORM 2200-CALC-GROSS-PAY
009900             PERFORM 2300-CALC-DEDUCTIONS
010000             PERFORM 2400-CALC-TAXES
010100             PERFORM 2500-WRITE-PAY-RECORD
010200         ELSE
010300             ADD 1 TO WS-ERR-CNT
010400         END-IF
010500         PERFORM 1100-READ-EMPLOYEE.
010600 2100-VALIDATE-EMPLOYEE.
010700         SET EMP-VALID TO TRUE
010800         IF EMP-HOURS NOT NUMERIC OR EMP-RATE NOT NUMERIC
010900             SET EMP-INVALID TO TRUE
011000         END-IF
011100         IF EMP-TERMINATED
011200             SET EMP-INVALID TO TRUE
011300         END-IF.
011400*GROSS
011500 2200-CALC-GROSS-PAY.
011600         EVALUATE TRUE
011700             WHEN EMP-SALARIED
011800                 COMPUTE WS-GROSS-PAY ROUNDED =
011900                     EMP-ANNUAL-SAL / 26
012000             WHEN EMP-HOURLY
012100                 IF EMP-HOURS > WS-STD-HRS
012200                     MOVE WS-STD-HRS TO WS-REG-HRS
012300                     COMPUTE WS-OT-HRS = EMP-HOURS - WS-STD-HRS
012400                 ELSE
012500                     MOVE EMP-HOURS TO WS-REG-HRS
012600                     MOVE ZERO TO WS-OT-HRS
012700                 END-IF
012800                 COMPUTE WS-OT-PAY =
012900                     WS-OT-HRS * EMP-RATE * WS-OT-RATE
013000                 COMPUTE WS-GROSS-PAY =
013100                     (WS-REG-HRS * EMP-RATE) + WS-OT-PAY
013200             WHEN OTHER
013300                 MOVE ZERO TO WS-GROSS-PAY
013400                 ADD 1 TO WS-ERR-CNT
013500         END-EVALUATE
013600         SET DEPT-IDX TO 1
013700         SEARCH WS-DEPT-ENTRY
013800             AT END CONTINUE
013900             WHEN WS-DEPT-CD (DEPT-IDX) = EMP-DEPT
014000                 COMPUTE WS-GROSS-PAY ROUNDED = WS-GROSS-PAY *
014100                     (1 + WS-DEPT-BONUS-PCT (DEPT-IDX))
014200         END-SEARCH
014300         ADD WS-GROSS-PAY TO WS-TOT-GROSS.
014400 2300-CALC-DEDUCTIONS.
014500         COMPUTE WS-TOT-DEDS = EMP-401K-PCT * WS-GROSS-PAY
014600         IF EMP-YTD-401K + WS-TOT-DEDS > WS-401K-MAX
014700             COMPUTE WS-TOT-DEDS = WS-401K-MAX - EMP-YTD-401K
014800         END-IF
014900         ADD EMP-HEALTH-PREM TO WS-TOT-DEDS
015000         COMPUTE WS-TAXABLE = WS-GROSS-PAY - WS-TOT-DEDS.
015100 2400-CALC-TAXES.
015200         MOVE WS-TAXABLE       TO TP-TAXABLE
015300         MOVE EMP-FILING-STAT  TO TP-FILING-STATUS
015400         CALL 'TAXCALC' USING WS-TAX-PARMS
015500         IF TP-RETURN-CD NOT = '00'
015600             DISPLAY 'TAXCALC FAILED FOR ' EMP-ID
015700             MOVE ZERO TO WS-FED-TAX
015800         ELSE
015900             MOVE TP-FED-TAX TO WS-FED-TAX
016000         END-IF
016100         COMPUTE WS-ST-TAX ROUNDED = WS-TAXABLE * WS-ST-TAX-RATE
016200         COMPUTE WS-NET-PAY = WS-GROSS-PAY - WS-TOT-DEDS
016300                            - WS-FED-TAX - WS-ST-TAX.
016400 2500-WRITE-PAY-RECORD.
016500         MOVE EMP-ID       TO PAY-EMP-ID
016600         MOVE WS-GROSS-PAY TO PAY-GROSS
016700         MOVE WS-FED-TAX   TO PAY-FED-TAX
016800         MOVE WS-ST-TAX    TO PAY-ST-TAX
016900         MOVE WS-TOT-DEDS  TO PAY-DEDS
017000         MOVE WS-NET-PAY   TO PAY-NET
017100         WRITE PAY-REC
017200         MOVE EMP-ID       TO RD-EMP-ID
017300         MOVE EMP-NAME     TO RD-EMP-NAME
017400         MOVE WS-GROSS-PAY TO RD-GROSS
017500         MOVE WS-NET-PAY   TO RD-NET
017600         WRITE RPT-LINE FROM WS-RPT-DETAIL AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE.
017700 9000-TERMINATE.
017800         CLOSE EMP-FILE PAY-FILE RPT-FILE
017900         DISPLAY 'RECORDS READ:    ' WS-REC-CNT
018000         DISPLAY 'RECORDS IN ERROR:' WS-ERR-CNT
018100         IF WS-ERR-CNT > 0
018200             MOVE 4 TO RETURN-CODE
018300         END-IF.
018400 9999-ABEND.
018500         DISPLAY 'PAYROLL ABENDING'
018600         STOP RUN.
